From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yan <Yan>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 16:20:33 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft v9.5 wildstacker virtual stack count

Items of the same type merge past the 64 cap via a virtual count stored in
ItemEntity.sourbycraftStackCount. ItemStack.count stays at <= maxStackSize
so the vanilla NBT codec never sees an illegal value.

Custom name ("Dirt x150") shown when virtual count > maxStackSize.
Player pickup gives one physical stack and decrements the virtual count;
entity sticks around until it reaches zero.

NBT key: SacStackCount. Config: performance.wildstacker.enabled.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/ItemEntity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/ItemEntity.java
index e82bb8f2d2b0e771dc371fd7e709116e1f5f204f..583d0d847283453274e2d17862e7b2d5c9389ef4 100644
